  - `SNIPER_BREAKOUT_INVALIDATION_STOP_MAX_SNAPSHOT_AGE_SECONDS`
  - `SNIPER_BREAKOUT_INVALIDATION_STOP_LOG_EVERY_SECONDS`
- Added entry-frozen stop anchor support in `SniperFilterEngine`:
  - new persisted anchor (`side`, `Hk`, `Lk`, `buffer_up`, `buffer_dn`, `armed_at_ms`)
  - invalidation timer state persisted for restart continuity
- Added breakout-invalidation stop APIs:
  - `arm_breakout_invalidation_stop(...)`
  - `evaluate_breakout_invalidation_stop(...)`
  - `clear_breakout_invalidation_stop()`
- Integrated breakout-invalidation stop checks into both sniper loops:
  - `_run_sniper_loop`
  - `_run_signal_sniper_loop`
- Stop trigger precedence now supports “same-reason” stop:
  - evaluate breakout invalidation first while in position
  - fire existing `_sniper_try_exit(..., \"STOP_LOSS\")` path on trigger
  - keep existing PnL stop-loss as backup and stale-feed hedge behavior unchanged
