- When enabled and anchored successfully, in-position exits can trigger early on Binance breakout invalidation (buffer re-entry + persistence), before PnL stop-loss.
- If Binance stop data is stale/missing/no-anchor, this stop path is suppressed and existing stop-loss framework remains active.

