## Version 0.1.9
Date: 2026-02-25
### Changes
- Added simple stop-loss retry delay control in `_sniper_try_exit`:
  - new env: `SNIPER_STOP_LOSS_RETRY_DELAY_SECONDS` (default `0.0`)
  - when reason is `STOP_LOSS`, this single value overrides internal retry sleeps (`200ms`, `150ms`, `1s`) and fail-pause backoffs (`0.5s`, `1s`, `2s`, `5s`, `60s`)
  - non-stop-loss paths keep existing timing behavior unchanged.
