### Behavior Impact
- Stop-loss exit retries are immediate by default (`SNIPER_STOP_LOSS_RETRY_DELAY_SECONDS=0`), reducing delay in fast moves.
- You can increase this single value if needed to reduce retry aggressiveness under poor allowance/balance conditions.

## Version 0.1.8
Date: 2026-02-24
### Changes
- Added entry-reason specific sniper TP/SL overrides with fallback to global values. (commit: `8d29844`)
  - `SNIPER_FORCE_DIFF_ENTRY_TAKE_PROFIT_PCT`
  - `SNIPER_FORCE_DIFF_ENTRY_STOP_LOSS_PCT`
